WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:22.214
the next few days, everyone at Monster Academy was busy preparing for the visit by the humans.

2
00:00:24.295 --> 00:00:28.436
Mr. Bog, the custodian, mopped up slime trails and drool puddles.

3
00:00:29.408 --> 00:00:33.490
The student council made a large Welcome, People banner to hang in the lobby.

4
00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.872
In the computer lab, Ben's class researched humans and tried to learn as much as they could.

5
00:00:43.714 --> 00:00:47.596
says here that humans don't howl at the moon," said a werewolf.

6
00:00:48.636 --> 00:00:49.576
He scratched his head.

7
00:00:49.596 --> 00:00:51.597
"That's weird."

8
00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:57.900
"Yeah, well, check this out," replied a two-headed girl at another computer.

9
00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:01.597
"Humans have only one brain."

10
00:01:04.098 --> 00:01:08.679
Ben was very curious about the humans too, and looking forward to their visit.

11
00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:11.960
But his mind was also on Winnie.

12
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.021
Ever since the dance, she'd been avoiding him.

13
00:01:17.321 --> 00:01:20.582
In Cooking one morning, he looked over and saw her watching him.

14
00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.684
She gave him a funny look and then turned away.

15
00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:30.689
"She's still really mad at me," realized Ben.

16
00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.791
He wondered how often she could read his thoughts.

17
00:01:34.651 --> 00:01:36.232
Did she know how bad he felt?

18
00:01:37.592 --> 00:01:41.154
Or how embarrassed he was that he couldn't float through walls like a real ghost?

19
00:01:47.596 --> 00:01:51.438
On the morning of the humans' visit, everyone gathered in the school's lobby.

20
00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:56.976
"The humans will be here any minute," said Mr.

21
00:01:57.036 --> 00:01:58.017
Freaky nervously.

22
00:01:58.037 --> 00:02:05.121
"It looks like everything here is totally under—" The principal gasped as he caught sight of Mog.

23
00:02:05.141 --> 00:02:06.802
"What's wrong?"

24
00:02:07.322 --> 00:02:08.043
asked Mog.

25
00:02:08.763 --> 00:02:10.424
Mr. Freaky started trembling.

26
00:02:10.444 --> 00:02:14.807
"You're covered in purple spots!"

27
00:02:15.787 --> 00:02:17.208
Mog looked down at himself.

28
00:02:22.191 --> 00:02:26.385
no! You're right—I am covered in purple spots.

29
00:02:27.385 --> 00:02:28.466
What are they?"

30
00:02:29.746 --> 00:02:31.647
Mr. Freaky shook his head gravely.

31
00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:33.168
"I don't know.

32
00:02:33.928 --> 00:02:35.929
You must have some kind of monster flu."

33
00:02:36.969 --> 00:02:38.250
Now Mog looked scared.

34
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.551
"Do you really think it's a flu?"

35
00:02:40.571 --> 00:02:43.552
"I'm afraid so," said Mr.

36
00:02:43.592 --> 00:02:46.813
Freaky. "You should go to the nurse's office right away.

37
00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:52.836
Please, Mog, the humans will be here soon, and I don't want them to see your spots."

38
00:02:52.896 --> 00:02:53.556
"Mr. Freaky!"

39
00:02:53.908 --> 00:02:54.508
cried a witch.

40
00:02:54.528 --> 00:02:57.070
"Winnie's covered in purple spots too!"

41
00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:00.031
Winnie shrieked and pointed at the other witch.

42
00:03:00.051 --> 00:03:02.393
"So are you!"

43
00:03:03.013 --> 00:03:05.675
The other witch screamed as she looked down at herself.

44
00:03:07.756 --> 00:03:10.017
Ben's eyes went wide as he looked around.

45
00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:14.860
Purple spots were appearing on all the students—even on himself.

46
00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.201
"Things are totally out of control!"

47
00:03:18.702 --> 00:03:19.242
cried Mr.

48
00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:22.664
Freaky. He took out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

49
00:03:27.211 --> 00:03:28.832
"I wish Miss Bungle were here.

50
00:03:29.712 --> 00:03:32.014
We have a full-blown epidemic in our school!"

51
00:03:32.034 --> 00:03:34.115
"What's an epidemic?"

52
00:03:34.596 --> 00:03:35.276
asked Mog.

53
00:03:36.057 --> 00:03:37.338
Waldo leaned toward him.

54
00:03:37.358 --> 00:03:41.500
"It's when a disease spreads all over a place, like a school."

55
00:03:43.722 --> 00:03:46.624
Mog looked at the purple spots on his hands and gulped.

56
00:03:48.105 --> 00:03:50.286
"Is this disease serious?"

57
00:03:51.527 --> 00:03:52.668
Waldo shook his head.

58
00:03:53.604 --> 00:03:54.164
"I hope not."

59
00:03:54.184 --> 00:03:57.946
"Everybody, go to the nurse's office!"

60
00:03:58.306 --> 00:03:58.786
said Mr.

61
00:03:58.846 --> 00:04:03.328
Freaky. "We can't have human visitors while we have a monster flu epidemic.

62
00:04:04.109 --> 00:04:07.210
When their bus arrives, I'll tell them we need to reschedule."

63
00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.531
The principal started pacing.

64
00:04:09.551 --> 00:04:12.713
"This is terrible.

65
00:04:13.373 --> 00:04:16.874
First Miss Bungle fell ill, and now all the students are sick too!"

66
00:04:17.975 --> 00:04:20.176
Students started heading toward the nurse's office.

67
00:04:20.992 --> 00:04:24.655
Ben was about to follow when he saw the bus from People Place pull up.

68
00:04:26.876 --> 00:04:31.439
Curious about the humans, he ducked behind a tall plant to watch for a few minutes.

69
00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.423
Mr. Freaky straightened his tie, took a deep breath, and headed outside.

70
00:04:42.067 --> 00:04:43.448
Ben slipped out after him.

71
00:04:48.648 --> 00:04:50.970
Mayor Hubbletree stepped off the bus with a grin.

72
00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.271
"Mr. Freaky!"

73
00:04:53.291 --> 00:04:56.974
"Good morning, Mayor," said Mr.

74
00:04:57.014 --> 00:05:00.456
Freaky. "I'm afraid I have some bad news."

75
00:05:01.497 --> 00:05:03.498
Mayor Hubbletree had suddenly frozen.

76
00:05:04.839 --> 00:05:06.580
He was staring curiously at Mr.

77
00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:10.643
Freaky. "What are all those purple spots?"

78
00:05:11.604 --> 00:05:12.284
"Purple spots?"

79
00:05:12.704 --> 00:05:13.185
said Mr.

80
00:05:13.245 --> 00:05:14.265
Freaky, alarmed.

81
00:05:15.066 --> 00:05:16.367
He looked down at his hands.

82
00:05:16.387 --> 00:05:17.748
"Oh dear.

83
00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.721
The epidemic is getting worse!"

84
00:05:20.781 --> 00:05:22.482
Mayor Hubbletree took a step back.

85
00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:27.384
"Epidemic? What's going on here, Freaky?"

86
00:05:27.404 --> 00:05:30.085
"Nothing!" cried Mr.

87
00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:34.367
Freaky. "It's just a minor illness, we think.

88
00:05:35.407 --> 00:05:37.068
Everything is totally under control."

89
00:05:37.088 --> 00:05:40.290
"It doesn't sound like it's under control.

90
00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.430
You just called it an epidemic."

91
00:05:43.431 --> 00:05:45.572
Mayor Hubbletree glanced at the school building.

92
00:05:47.812 --> 00:05:53.595
"I can't bring students into Monster Academy if you're all sick with some weird monster disease!"

93
00:05:53.615 --> 00:05:56.376
"You're right," said Mr.

94
00:05:56.416 --> 00:05:59.957
Freaky. "Maybe we should reschedule the field trip for next week."

95
00:05:59.977 --> 00:06:01.698
"Are you kidding?"

96
00:06:02.138 --> 00:06:03.379
cried Mayor Hubbletree.

97
00:06:03.399 --> 00:06:06.060
"I'm not rescheduling the field trip.

98
00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:11.002
Whatever crazy monster illness you have in there, I want no part of it!

99
00:06:11.882 --> 00:06:16.064
In fact, I'm sending over a health inspector to look into this epidemic.

100
00:06:17.308 --> 00:06:20.189
My wife and Dave have been inside that building!"

101
00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.070
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands, muttering to himself.

102
00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:31.872
"This is terrible—I was really hoping the fence between Monsterville and People Place would be taken down."

103
00:06:32.893 --> 00:06:36.514
Ben drew in a breath as the mayor folded his arms and scowled.

104
00:06:36.534 --> 00:06:43.516
"Oh, that fence is coming down, all right," Mayor Hubbletree snapped.

105
00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.190
"I'm going to replace it with an enormous concrete wall!"
